{
	"info": {
		"name": "Quizify - Browser Slot Management Testing",
		"description": "Test distributed browser slot coordination across multiple instances.\n\n## What This Tests\n- Browser slot acquisition (max 3 per user)\n- Distributed locking across instances\n- Automatic slot release (5 min TTL)\n- Quota enforcement (429 errors)\n- Concurrent user isolation\n\n## Expected Behavior\n- User can acquire up to 3 browser slots\n- 4th attempt returns HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests)\n- Slots automatically released after 5 minutes\n- Different users don't interfere with each other\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `base_url` to your Railway production URL\n2. Get valid JWT tokens for 2 different users:\n   - `auth_token_user1` (User A)\n   - `auth_token_user2` (User B)\n3. Have a test URL ready (e.g., Wikipedia article)\n\n## Test Scenarios\n1. **Single User Quota** - Test 3 slot limit\n2. **Concurrent Users** - Verify user isolation\n3. **Slot Release** - Test TTL cleanup\n4. **Production Load** - Stress test with multiple users",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health & Setup",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Redis Health Check",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Redis is enabled\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.redis_enabled).to.eql(true);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Redis is connected\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.redis_connected).to.eql(true);",
									"});",
									"",
									"console.log(\"✅ Redis Status:\", pm.response.json());"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/health/redis",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["health", "redis"]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
